    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span arial=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The flank wall of the proposed dormer&amp;nbsp;would not be finished in an external material that would be similar in appearance to the materials used in the exterior of the main roof of the host dwelling.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span arial=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The proposed development would&amp;nbsp;therefore not be within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class B, Condition B.2 (a) of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 as amended.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal is therefore NOT a lawful development&lt;/p&gt;"
